{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45525","headline":"悼罗隐 · 归仁","name":"悼罗隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一着谗书未快心，几抽胸臆纵狂吟。\n管中窥豹我犹在，海上钓鳌君也沈。\n岁月尽能消愤懑，寰区那更有知音。\n长安冠盖皆涂地，仍喜先生葬碧岑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"归仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}